<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Gencor Alusaf yr shr surges, div declared.</title>
<headline>Gencor Alusaf yr shr surges, div declared.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr ended June 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     89.4	  vs 34.2</p>
<p>    Diluted shr (cts)     83.7	  vs 31.2</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 30.91	 vs nil</p>
<p>    Net income	     165.0	  vs 57.0</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		  256.0	  vs 63.0</p>
<p>    Tax			 91.0	  vs  6.0</p>
<p>    Interest paid	  187.0	  vs 20.0</p>
<p>    Turnover	     2,604.0	  vs 1,125.0</p>
<p>Div payable</p>
<p>on register June 30</p>
<p>Full name: Alusaf, a unit of Gencor Ltd</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
